 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<div>\r\n  {% if letter_head and not no_letterhead -%}\r\n    <div class=\"letter-head\">{{ letter_head }}</div>\r\n    <hr>\r\n  {%- endif %}\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin:2px 0;font-size:14px;\"><b>DISCHARGE FORM</b></h2>\r\n  <hr>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:0; padding:0; font-size:12px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Date:</strong> {{ doc.date }}\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <hr style=\"margin:2px 0;\">\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:0; padding:0;font-size:12px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Pet Name:</strong> {{ doc.pet_name }}\r\n      </td>\r\n      <td style=\"text-align:right; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Pet Owner:</strong> {{ doc.pet_owner or ''}}\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n       <td style=\"text-align:left; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Follow-up Visit Date:</strong> {{ doc.follow_up_visit_date or '' }}\r\n       </td>\r\n       <td style=\"text-align:right; width:50%; padding:0;\">\r\n        <strong>Owner Phone No::</strong> {{ doc.owner_phone_no or '' }}\r\n       </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table><br><br>\r\n <p><strong>For the recovery care of your pet please read the following information.</strong></p>\r\n <p>{{doc.diagnosis}}</p><br>\r\n<p><strong>Outpatient Medicines with instructions</strong></p>\r\n <ol>\r\n  {% if doc.med1 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med1 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med2 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med2 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med3 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med3 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n  {% if doc.med4 %}\r\n    <li><p>{{ doc.med4 }}</p></li>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </ol><br>\r\n <p><strong>Status of pet condition at the time of discharge: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.fully_recovered ==1 %} \r\n   <i>Fully Recovered</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>In recovery stage </i>\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n <p><strong>Diet: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.normal ==1 %} \r\n   <i>Normal</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>Other </i>\r\n    {{doc.data_pkef or ''}}\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n <p><strong>Exercise: </strong>\r\n {% if doc.no_restrictions ==1 %} \r\n   <i>No restrictions</i>\r\n  {% else %}\r\n    <i>Other </i>\r\n    {{doc.data_wqug or ''}}\r\n  {% endif %}\r\n </p>\r\n {% if doc. small_text_mplj %} \r\n <p><strong>Special Instructions, if any</strong> <br>\r\n {{doc.small_text_mplj}}</p>\r\n {% endif %}\r\n <p>Kindly follow all instructions otherwise vet will not be responsible for any mishap with your pet at your place,\r\n In case any emerency prior to the follow-up visit date, bring the pet to the clinic.</p>\r\n <table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:20px; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; padding:0; text-align:left;\">\r\n      <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"height:120px; vertical-align:bottom; text-align:center;\">\r\n            {% if doc.owner_signature %}\r\n              <img src=\"{{ doc.owner_signature }}\"style=\"max-width:220px; max-height:80px; display:block; margin:0 auto 6px;\" />\r\n            {% else %}\r\n              <div style=\"width:220px; height:80px; border-bottom:1px solid #333; margin:0 auto 6px;\"></div>\r\n            {% endif %}\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;\">Owner/Pet Receiver signature</div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n\r\n    <td style=\"width:50%; padding:0; text-align:right;\">\r\n      <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"height:120px; vertical-align:bottom; text-align:center;\">\r\n            {% if doc.veterinarian_signature %}\r\n              <img src=\"{{ doc.veterinarian_signature }}\"\r\n                   style=\"max-width:220px; max-height:80px; display:block; margin:0 auto 6px;\" />\r\n            {% else %}\r\n              <div style=\"width:220px; height:80px; border-bottom:1px solid #333; margin:0 auto 6px;\"></div>\r\n            {% endif %}\r\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;\">Veterinarian / Discharged by</div>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n",
